@startuml ModeratedLMS CR1 Class Design
title Moderated LMS - CR1 Class Design

class Lecturer <<role>>
class Student <<role>>

class Database <<repository>> {
  +grantExtension(actor, assignmentId, studentId, newDeadline, reason)
  +grantClassExtension(actor, assignmentId, newDeadline, reason)
  +assignmentsForStudent(student)
  +submit(student, assignmentId, filePath)
  +saveMark(lecturer, submissionId, rawMark, feedback, reason)
}

class AssignmentRecord <<view model>> {
  +id: int
  +deadline: string
  +effectiveDeadline: string
}

entity "class_extensions" as ClassExtension <<table>> {
  assignment_id: int <<PK/FK>>
  new_deadline: string
  reason: string
  granted_by: int <<FK>>
}

entity "extensions" as IndividualExtension <<table>> {
  extension_id: int <<PK>>
  assignment_id: int <<FK>>
  student_id: int <<FK>>
  new_deadline: string
  reason: string
  granted_by: int <<FK>>
}

Lecturer ..> Database : grants class or\nindividual extension
Student ..> Database : views and submits
Database --> ClassExtension : persists class deadline
Database --> IndividualExtension : preserves per-student deadline
Database ..> AssignmentRecord : returns original and\neffective deadlines
ClassExtension ..> AssignmentRecord : participates in max deadline
IndividualExtension ..> AssignmentRecord : participates in max deadline

note bottom of Database
  Effective deadline is the latest of
  the original, class-wide and individual
  deadlines. Marking also uses that value.
end note
@enduml
